\frac{x}{y}=\frac{1}{m}

Let $y=m x$ be the tangent
Applying,

\begin{aligned}
& p=r \\
&\left|\frac{3 m-4}{\sqrt{1+m^2}}\right|=2 \\
& 9 m^2-24 m+16=4+4 m^2 \\
& 5 m^2-24 m+12=0 \\
& 12 m^2-24 m+5=0 \\
& \frac{m_1}{m_1}
\end{aligned}

